{"seq":1,"slug":"cli-testing","title":"CLI 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/testing-and-publishing/cli-testing","wordCount":691,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"cli-测试\">CLI 测试</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>CLI 测试</strong>的独特之处在于：被测对象是一个<strong>行为边界</strong>，而非一个函数。输入是命令行参数与 stdin，输出是 stdout、stderr 与退出码——测试要从用户视角验证这三者的组合。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试类型</th>\n<th>验证对象</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>内部函数逻辑</td>\n<td><code>#[test]</code> / vitest</td>\n<td>函数级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>命令行行为</td>\n<td>assert_cmd</td>\n<td>命令级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快照测试</td>\n<td>输出文本</td>\n<td>insta</td>\n<td>输出级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2E 测试</td>\n<td>完整工作流</td>\n<td>shell 脚本</td>\n<td>流程级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>据此形成<strong>测试金字塔</strong>：单元测试数量最多、集成测试居中、E2E 最少。CLI 的集成测试需同时断言 stdout、stderr 与退出码，这一点与普通单元测试有本质区别。本文从独特性讲到各类工具。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"cli-测试的独特性\">CLI 测试的独特性</h2><p><strong>CLI 测试</strong>（CLI Testing）与普通单元测试有本质区别：输入是命令行参数和 stdin 数据，输出是 stdout 文本、stderr 错误信息和退出码。测试需要从用户的视角验证工具的行为。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试类型</th>\n<th>验证对象</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>内部函数逻辑</td>\n<td><code>#[test]</code> / vitest</td>\n<td>函数级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>命令行行为</td>\n<td>assert_cmd</td>\n<td>命令级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快照测试</td>\n<td>输出文本</td>\n<td>insta / toml</td>\n<td>输出级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2E 测试</td>\n<td>完整工作流</td>\n<td>shell 脚本</td>\n<td>流程级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[测试金字塔] --&gt; B[单元测试 - 大量]&#10;    A --&gt; C[集成测试 - 中量]&#10;    A --&gt; D[E2E 测试 - 少量]&#10;    B --&gt; E[函数逻辑、数据转换]&#10;    C --&gt; F[命令行参数、输出格式]&#10;    D --&gt; G[完整工作流、文件系统操作]\">graph TD\n    A[测试金字塔] --&gt; B[单元测试 - 大量]\n    A --&gt; C[集成测试 - 中量]\n    A --&gt; D[E2E 测试 - 少量]\n    B --&gt; E[函数逻辑、数据转换]\n    C --&gt; F[命令行参数、输出格式]\n    D --&gt; G[完整工作流、文件系统操作]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"rust-assert_cmd\">Rust：assert_cmd</h2><p><strong>assert_cmd</strong> 提供了优雅的 API 来测试 Rust CLI 工具的命令行行为。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[cfg(test)]&#10;mod tests {&#10;    use assert_cmd::Command;&#10;    use predicates::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_help_output() {&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .arg(&quot;--help&quot;)&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .success()&#10;            .stdout(predicate::str::contains(&quot;用法&quot;))&#10;            .stdout(predicate::str::contains(&quot;--verbose&quot;));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_version() {&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .arg(&quot;--version&quot;)&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .success()&#10;            .stdout(predicate::str::starts_with(&quot;mytool &quot;));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_missing_argument() {&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .failure()&#10;            .stderr(predicate::str::contains(&quot;错误&quot;));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_file_processing() {&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .arg(&quot;process&quot;)&#10;            .arg(&quot;test-data/sample.txt&quot;)&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .success()&#10;            .stdout(predicate::str::contains(&quot;处理完成&quot;));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_stdin_input() {&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .arg(&quot;count&quot;)&#10;            .write_stdin(&quot;line1\\nline2\\nline3\\n&quot;)&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .success()&#10;            .stdout(&quot;3\\n&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_exit_code() {&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .arg(&quot;validate&quot;)&#10;            .arg(&quot;nonexistent.toml&quot;)&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .code(1);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(test)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mod tests {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use assert_cmd::Command;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use predicates::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_help_output() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(\"--help\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .stdout(predicate::str::contains(\"用法\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .stdout(predicate::str::contains(\"--verbose\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_version() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(\"--version\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .stdout(predicate::str::starts_with(\"mytool \"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_missing_argument() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .failure()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .stderr(predicate::str::contains(\"错误\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_file_processing() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(\"process\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(\"test-data/sample.txt\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .stdout(predicate::str::contains(\"处理完成\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_stdin_input() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(\"count\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .write_stdin(\"line1\\nline2\\nline3\\n\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .stdout(\"3\\n\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_exit_code() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(\"validate\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(\"nonexistent.toml\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .code(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"assert_fs-文件系统测试\">assert_fs：文件系统测试</h2><p><strong>assert_fs</strong> 提供临时目录和文件断言，用于测试涉及文件系统操作的命令。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[cfg(test)]&#10;mod tests {&#10;    use assert_cmd::Command;&#10;    use assert_fs::prelude::*;&#10;    use assert_fs::TempDir;&#10;    use predicates::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_init_creates_project() {&#10;        let temp = TempDir::new().unwrap();&#10;&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .arg(&quot;init&quot;)&#10;            .arg(&quot;my-project&quot;)&#10;            .current_dir(temp.path())&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .success();&#10;&#10;        temp.child(&quot;my-project&quot;).assert(predicate::path::is_dir());&#10;        temp.child(&quot;my-project/Cargo.toml&quot;).assert(predicate::path::exists());&#10;        temp.child(&quot;my-project/src/main.rs&quot;).assert(predicate::path::exists());&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_config_generation() {&#10;        let temp = TempDir::new().unwrap();&#10;        let config = temp.child(&quot;config.toml&quot;);&#10;        config.write_str(&quot;[project]\\nname = \\&quot;test\\&quot;\\n&quot;).unwrap();&#10;&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .arg(&quot;validate&quot;)&#10;            .arg(config.path())&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .success()&#10;            .stdout(predicate::str::contains(&quot;配置有效&quot;));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_output_file() {&#10;        let temp = TempDir::new().unwrap();&#10;        let input = temp.child(&quot;input.txt&quot;);&#10;        input.write_str(&quot;hello\\nworld\\n&quot;).unwrap();&#10;&#10;        let output = temp.child(&quot;output.txt&quot;);&#10;&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .args([&quot;transform&quot;, &quot;--output&quot;])&#10;            .arg(output.path())&#10;            .arg(input.path())&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .success();&#10;&#10;        output.assert(predicate::str::contains(&quot;HELLO&quot;));&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(test)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mod tests {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use assert_cmd::Command;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use assert_fs::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use assert_fs::TempDir;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use predicates::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_init_creates_project() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let temp = TempDir::new().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(\"init\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(\"my-project\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .current_dir(temp.path())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .success();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        temp.child(\"my-project\").assert(predicate::path::is_dir());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        temp.child(\"my-project/Cargo.toml\").assert(predicate::path::exists());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        temp.child(\"my-project/src/main.rs\").assert(predicate::path::exists());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_config_generation() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let temp = TempDir::new().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let config = temp.child(\"config.toml\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        config.write_str(\"[project]\\nname = \\\"test\\\"\\n\").unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(\"validate\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(config.path())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .stdout(predicate::str::contains(\"配置有效\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_output_file() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let temp = TempDir::new().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let input = temp.child(\"input.txt\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        input.write_str(\"hello\\nworld\\n\").unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let output = temp.child(\"output.txt\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .args([\"transform\", \"--output\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(output.path())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .arg(input.path())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .success();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        output.assert(predicate::str::contains(\"HELLO\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"快照测试\">快照测试</h2><p><strong>快照测试</strong>（Snapshot Testing）冻结命令的输出，后续运行时自动与快照比对。Rust 的 <strong>insta</strong> 是这一领域的标准工具。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[cfg(test)]&#10;mod tests {&#10;    use assert_cmd::Command;&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_list_output_snapshot() {&#10;        let output = Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .args([&quot;list&quot;, &quot;--format&quot;, &quot;text&quot;])&#10;            .output()&#10;            .unwrap();&#10;&#10;        let stdout = String::from_utf8(output.stdout).unwrap();&#10;        insta::assert_snapshot!(&quot;list_text_output&quot;, stdout);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_json_output_snapshot() {&#10;        let output = Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .args([&quot;list&quot;, &quot;--format&quot;, &quot;json&quot;])&#10;            .output()&#10;            .unwrap();&#10;&#10;        let stdout = String::from_utf8(output.stdout).unwrap();&#10;        let value: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_str(&amp;stdout).unwrap();&#10;        insta::assert_json_snapshot!(&quot;list_json_output&quot;, value);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(test)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mod tests {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use assert_cmd::Command;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_list_output_snapshot() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let output = Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .args([\"list\", \"--format\", \"text\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .output()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let stdout = String::from_utf8(output.stdout).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        insta::assert_snapshot!(\"list_text_output\", stdout);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_json_output_snapshot() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let output = Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .args([\"list\", \"--format\", \"json\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .output()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let stdout = String::from_utf8(output.stdout).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let value: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_str(&#x26;stdout).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        insta::assert_json_snapshot!(\"list_json_output\", value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>快照操作</th>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首次生成</td>\n<td><code>cargo test</code></td>\n<td>自动创建快照文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审查变更</td>\n<td><code>cargo insta review</code></td>\n<td>交互式审查差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接受更新</td>\n<td><code>cargo insta accept</code></td>\n<td>接受新的快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒绝变更</td>\n<td><code>cargo insta reject</code></td>\n<td>恢复原有快照</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 快照测试非常适合验证 <code>--help</code> 输出、格式化文本和 JSON 响应。当输出发生意外变化时能立即被发现。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"e2e-测试\">E2E 测试</h2><p><strong>端到端测试</strong>（End-to-End Testing）验证完整的用户工作流，包括安装、配置、执行和清理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[cfg(test)]&#10;mod e2e {&#10;    use assert_cmd::Command;&#10;    use assert_fs::TempDir;&#10;    use predicates::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_full_workflow() {&#10;        let workspace = TempDir::new().unwrap();&#10;&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .args([&quot;init&quot;, &quot;demo-project&quot;, &quot;--template&quot;, &quot;minimal&quot;])&#10;            .current_dir(workspace.path())&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .success()&#10;            .stdout(predicate::str::contains(&quot;项目创建成功&quot;));&#10;&#10;        let project_dir = workspace.child(&quot;demo-project&quot;);&#10;&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .args([&quot;build&quot;])&#10;            .current_dir(project_dir.path())&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .success()&#10;            .stdout(predicate::str::contains(&quot;构建完成&quot;));&#10;&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .args([&quot;test&quot;])&#10;            .current_dir(project_dir.path())&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .success();&#10;&#10;        Command::cargo_bin(&quot;mytool&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .args([&quot;clean&quot;])&#10;            .current_dir(project_dir.path())&#10;            .assert()&#10;            .success();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(test)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mod e2e {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use assert_cmd::Command;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use assert_fs::TempDir;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use predicates::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_full_workflow() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let workspace = TempDir::new().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .args([\"init\", \"demo-project\", \"--template\", \"minimal\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .current_dir(workspace.path())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .stdout(predicate::str::contains(\"项目创建成功\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let project_dir = workspace.child(\"demo-project\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .args([\"build\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .current_dir(project_dir.path())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .stdout(predicate::str::contains(\"构建完成\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .args([\"test\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .current_dir(project_dir.path())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .success();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Command::cargo_bin(\"mytool\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .args([\"clean\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .current_dir(project_dir.path())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assert()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .success();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[init] --&gt; B[build]&#10;    B --&gt; C[test]&#10;    C --&gt; D[deploy]&#10;    D --&gt; E[clean]\">graph LR\n    A[init] --&gt; B[build]\n    B --&gt; C[test]\n    C --&gt; D[deploy]\n    D --&gt; E[clean]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((CLI 测试))&#10;    assert_cmd&#10;      命令行参数&#10;      stdout/stderr 断言&#10;      退出码验证&#10;    assert_fs&#10;      临时目录&#10;      文件系统断言&#10;      测试隔离&#10;    快照测试&#10;      insta&#10;      输出冻结&#10;      交互式审查&#10;    E2E 测试&#10;      完整工作流&#10;      真实文件系统&#10;      集成验证\">mindmap\n  root((CLI 测试))\n    assert_cmd\n      命令行参数\n      stdout/stderr 断言\n      退出码验证\n    assert_fs\n      临时目录\n      文件系统断言\n      测试隔离\n    快照测试\n      insta\n      输出冻结\n      交互式审查\n    E2E 测试\n      完整工作流\n      真实文件系统\n      集成验证</pre><ul>\n<li>CLI 测试从用户视角验证工具行为，关注参数解析、输出格式和退出码</li>\n<li>assert_cmd 是 Rust CLI 集成测试的标准工具，支持 stdin 注入和 stdout/stderr 断言</li>\n<li>assert_fs 提供临时目录和文件断言，确保文件系统测试的隔离性</li>\n<li>快照测试适合验证格式化输出和帮助文本，insta 提供交互式的快照审查流程</li>\n<li>E2E 测试验证完整的用户工作流，但应控制数量，聚焦核心场景</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CLI 测试","id":"cli-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CLI 测试的独特性","id":"cli-测试的独特性"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust：assert_cmd","id":"rust-assert_cmd"},{"level":2,"text":"assert_fs：文件系统测试","id":"assert_fs-文件系统测试"},{"level":2,"text":"快照测试","id":"快照测试"},{"level":2,"text":"E2E 测试","id":"e2e-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"打包与分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/nodejs-cli/bundling-and-distribution"},"next":{"title":"CI 与发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/testing-and-publishing/ci-and-release"}}